<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 192 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 192 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 192 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	   5		   5		    7.50</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 101		 101		    8.50</p>
<p>    Five years	46		  46		    9.50</p>
<p>    10-years	  40		  40		    10</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    192		 192</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for May 12, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.47 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518 REUTER WB/LG</p>
</text>
